sequenceDiagram
    participant WebUI as Open WebUI container
    participant Router as Ollama router 11436
    participant GPU as Ollama GPU 11434
    participant CPU as Ollama CPU 11435
    participant Model as Modelo local

    WebUI->>Router: GET /api/tags
    Router->>GPU: encaminha consulta
    GPU-->>Router: lista modelos
    Router-->>WebUI: lista modelos
    WebUI->>Router: POST /api/chat
    Router->>GPU: modelos GPU/default
    Router->>CPU: modelos CPU
    GPU->>Model: carregar modelo
    CPU->>Model: carregar modelo
    Model-->>Router: resposta
    Router-->>WebUI: mensagem
